WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.885 --> 00:00:17.148
man tapped the hammer gently on something small and blue.

2
00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:20.711
The children heard something breaking.

3
00:00:20.731 --> 00:00:23.093
"Is he Master Antonius?"

4
00:00:23.874 --> 00:00:24.554
asked Vinnie.

5
00:00:24.574 --> 00:00:31.200
"Oh no, this man is a mosaic artist," said Varius, pointing to the floor.

6
00:00:32.168 --> 00:00:34.630
It was a mosaic of animals and fish.

7
00:00:35.671 --> 00:00:37.893
They examined the mosaic closer.

8
00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:43.137
Little pieces of pottery were stuck together to create a picture.

9
00:00:43.157 --> 00:00:45.799
"That's amazing!"

10
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:47.401
cried Mandy.

11
00:00:48.341 --> 00:00:53.866
A servant finally came and led them to a courtyard in the center of the house.

12
00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:58.930
"This is different from Melus' house," remarked Mandy.

13
00:01:00.211 --> 00:01:01.052
A man appeared.

14
00:01:01.536 --> 00:01:03.037
He wore a large ring.

15
00:01:03.057 --> 00:01:06.438
"Varius!" said the man.

16
00:01:06.458 --> 00:01:08.979
"What's the matter?

17
00:01:09.199 --> 00:01:10.080
Be quick, boy.

18
00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:13.141
I must get to the games soon."

19
00:01:13.161 --> 00:01:18.583
"Master Antonius, Aquila is in danger," warned Varius.

20
00:01:19.584 --> 00:01:21.484
"Today's race will not be a fair one."

21
00:01:22.645 --> 00:01:26.847
He told Antonius what Mandy had overheard in the bathhouse.

22
00:01:26.867 --> 00:01:29.988
"Poisoning the horses?"

23
00:01:30.716 --> 00:01:32.197
said Master Antonius.

24
00:01:32.217 --> 00:01:35.220
"Horrible! You are sure of this?"

25
00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:40.024
"Brutus wants to win very badly," said Varius.

26
00:01:41.025 --> 00:01:42.546
"He should be watched carefully."

27
00:01:42.566 --> 00:01:48.491
"I'll have extra guards put near the stable," Master Antonius said.

28
00:01:48.511 --> 00:01:50.193
"Thank you!"

29
00:01:50.693 --> 00:01:53.736
cried Varius, as he and the children left.

30
00:01:53.756 --> 00:01:57.098
"Now what do we do, Varius?"

31
00:01:57.859 --> 00:01:58.620
asked Mandy.

32
00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:01.669
"We'll go to the Circus Maximus.

33
00:02:02.709 --> 00:02:03.989
The race will begin soon.

34
00:02:04.969 --> 00:02:08.030
We have done all that we can," Varius said.

35
00:02:09.071 --> 00:02:11.171
They walked slowly down the road.

36
00:02:12.112 --> 00:02:14.492
A large crowd was walking ahead of them.

37
00:02:14.512 --> 00:02:18.013
"Are they all going to the race?"

38
00:02:18.874 --> 00:02:19.554
asked Vinnie.

39
00:02:19.574 --> 00:02:23.175
"Oh yes, people love the chariot races.

40
00:02:23.815 --> 00:02:28.200
Everyone comes to watch and bet on them," said Varius.

41
00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:31.121
They followed the crowd into a large arena.

42
00:02:31.141 --> 00:02:36.762
"Whoa!" Vinnie and Mandy cried together.

43
00:02:37.923 --> 00:02:42.004
The Circus Maximus was a huge arena with many seats.

44
00:02:43.044 --> 00:02:45.805
In the middle of the track was a long stage.

45
00:02:46.945 --> 00:02:49.546
The stage had a huge tower in the middle.

46
00:02:50.606 --> 00:02:52.887
At both ends of the stage were posts.

47
00:02:53.967 --> 00:02:56.108
Metal objects were on a thick bar.

48
00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.961
"Vinnie! The photo!"

49
00:02:59.641 --> 00:03:00.541
Mandy shouted.

50
00:03:00.561 --> 00:03:03.102
"The old man was here!"

51
00:03:04.122 --> 00:03:05.602
Vinnie took out the photo.

52
00:03:06.122 --> 00:03:07.363
It was glowing blue.

53
00:03:07.383 --> 00:03:09.743
"You're right!"

54
00:03:10.324 --> 00:03:11.004
he cried.

55
00:03:11.024 --> 00:03:12.824
"But what are they?"

56
00:03:13.545 --> 00:03:15.965
He pointed to the objects on the bar.

57
00:03:15.985 --> 00:03:20.266
"There are seven of them Mandy counted.

58
00:03:20.286 --> 00:03:22.787
"I think they are dolphins!

59
00:03:23.407 --> 00:03:25.908
But what are they for, Varius?"

60
00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:31.965
"One dolphin is turned up every time the racers go around the track," said Varius.

61
00:03:31.985 --> 00:03:34.908
"Each time around the track is a lap.

62
00:03:35.789 --> 00:03:39.092
The dolphins let the racers know how many laps they have to go."

63
00:03:40.593 --> 00:03:43.636
Just then a tall man walked over to them.

64
00:03:44.817 --> 00:03:47.059
He looked down at Vinnie and Mandy.

65
00:03:47.079 --> 00:03:49.001
"I am Aquila.

66
00:03:49.442 --> 00:03:51.363
Are you the children who saved my life?"
